---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { fullAddress, site } from '../config/site';
import PageHero from '../components/PageHero.astro';

const crumbs = [{ name: 'Privacy Policy', path: '/privacy/' }];
// TODO-confirm: effective date and the name of NVA's Data Protection Officer.
const updated = 'September 2026';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="How NVA Printing Services collects, uses and protects your personal information under the Philippine Data Privacy Act of 2012 (RA 10173)."
  crumbs={crumbs}
>
  <PageHero crumbs={crumbs} label="Privacy policy" title="Your data, handled with care." accent="ink">
    This policy explains what personal information we collect through this website and our shop, why we collect it, and your rights
    under the Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173). Last updated {updated}.
  </PageHero>

  <div class="container-x py-12 sm:py-16">
    <article class="prose-nva max-w-3xl">
      <h2>1. Who we are</h2>
      <p>
        {site.name} (“NVA”, “we”, “us”) is a printing shop at {fullAddress}. We are the personal information controller for the
        information described here.
      </p>

      <h2>2. What we collect</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Contact details</strong>: your name, mobile number, email address and, for bulk inquiries, your company, school or organization.</li>
        <li><strong>Order details</strong>: products, quantities, sizes, deadlines, budget range and notes you give us.</li>
        <li><strong>Files</strong>: artwork, logos and photos you upload or send. These may contain personal information such as names or faces.</li>
        <li><strong>Messages</strong>: what you send us on Messenger, SMS, email or phone.</li>
        <li><strong>Technical data</strong>: our hosting provider keeps basic server logs (such as IP address and browser type) to keep the website secure and running.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We do not use advertising or tracking cookies on this website.</p>

      <h2>3. Why we use it</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To reply to your quote request or inquiry and prepare your quotation.</li>
        <li>To design, print, finish and release or deliver your order.</li>
        <li>To contact you about your order, payment, pick-up or delivery.</li>
        <li>To keep records required by law, such as tax and accounting records.</li>
        <li>To review job applications sent to our HR email.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We process your information based on your consent, to fulfill our agreement with you, and to comply with legal obligations, as
        allowed under Section 12 of the Data Privacy Act. We will not use your information for marketing without asking you first.
      </p>

      <h2>4. Who we share it with</h2>
      <p>We never sell your personal information. We only share it when needed to serve you:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Service providers that run this website and deliver form emails to us (web hosting and email delivery).</li>
        <li>Our order-tracking system, if you place or track an order online.</li>
        <li>Couriers or delivery riders, only the details needed to deliver your order.</li>
        <li>Government authorities, when required by law.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Some of these providers may store data outside the Philippines. We use reputable providers that protect data with appropriate safeguards.</p>

      <h2>5. How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>
        Quote requests that don’t become orders are deleted within one (1) year. Order and payment records are kept for as long as
        required by tax and business laws. Artwork files are kept for up to one (1) year after your order so you can easily reorder,
        unless you ask us to delete them sooner. Job applications are kept for up to one (1) year.
      </p>

      <h2>6. How we protect it</h2>
      <p>
        The website uses encrypted connections (HTTPS). Access to customer information and files is limited to staff who need it to
        handle your order. We take reasonable organizational, physical and technical measures to protect your information against loss,
        misuse and unauthorized access.
      </p>

      <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
      <p>Under the Data Privacy Act, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>be informed about how your personal information is processed;</li>
        <li>access the personal information we hold about you;</li>
        <li>object to processing, and withdraw your consent;</li>
        <li>have inaccurate information corrected;</li>
        <li>have your information erased or blocked when it is no longer needed or was processed unlawfully;</li>
        <li>get a copy of your information in a commonly used electronic format (data portability);</li>
        <li>be indemnified for damages caused by inaccurate or unlawfully processed information; and</li>
        <li>file a complaint with the National Privacy Commission (privacy.gov.ph).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Contact us</h2>
      <p>
        For privacy questions or to exercise your rights, contact our Data Protection Officer at
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Data%20privacy%20request`}>{site.email}</a>, call
        <a href={`tel:${site.phone.mobile.tel}`}>{site.phone.mobile.label}</a>, or visit us at the shop. We will respond within a
        reasonable time.
      </p>

      <h2>9. Changes to this policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. The latest version is always on this page, with the date it was last updated.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .prose-nva :global(h2) {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 2.5rem 0 0.75rem;
  }
  .prose-nva :global(h2:first-child) {
    margin-top: 0;
  }
  .prose-nva :global(p),
  .prose-nva :global(ul) {
    margin: 0.75rem 0;
  }
  .prose-nva :global(ul) {
    list-style: disc;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
  }
  .prose-nva :global(li) {
    margin: 0.35rem 0;
  }
  .prose-nva :global(li::marker) {
    color: var(--color-magenta);
  }
  .prose-nva :global(a) {
    font-weight: 600;
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-magenta);
    text-decoration-thickness: 2px;
    text-underline-offset: 4px;
    word-break: break-word;
  }
</style>
